      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time spent per second (inclusive)",
      "description": "Seconds of wall time per second inside each span, children included: checkStaticAbilities time is also counted inside checkStateEffects and mainLoopStep. 1.0 = the sim thread is always in it.",
